  •  COMPDBG shows:
    host=0x1000000A kid=0x1000000B mapped=1
    geom=738x658
    fb=500x546
  So: 
    WindowTable geometry ≠ child framebuffer size
  This mismatch causes compositor to use geometry bounds larger than child FB, so only part gets drawn.

